items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Flawed.name=Flawed Diamond
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Flawed.description=A diamond given a flawed cut. No element powers, and it may carry a weakness to every element. Set in jewelry, it adds 75% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Fine.name=Fine Diamond
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Fine.description=A diamond given a fine cut. All-element resistance; at half strength. Set in jewelry, it adds 100% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Flawless.name=Flawless Diamond
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Flawless.description=A diamond given a flawless cut. All-element resistance and crit chance. Set in jewelry, it adds 125% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Perfect.name=Perfect Diamond
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Perfect.description=A diamond given a perfect cut. All-element resistance and crit chance; at full strength, with a chance of all-element resistance. Set in jewelry, it adds 150% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
